Run the agent
gather runs one turn of the agent on ramabana_lead: ramabana’s read and web tools, its sub-agents, and abhyasa’s own tools, with the caps of the lead, research.agent_minutes and 200 documents. A watch thread cancels the turn on Stop or when the time is up, and each tool refuses after that. At the end, a paper that gave no passage is forgotten, and each step with no passage says how many documents the agent read for it. When the agent cannot start, the walk gets gather_why, and the simple search (research_walk) runs.


source

gather
def gather(
    lr:abhyasa.store.Learning, jid:str, stop:threading.Event, ask:NoneType=None, search:NoneType=None,
    fetch:NoneType=None, paper:NoneType=None
)-&gt;fastcore.basics.AttrDict:
Let a ramabana agent (ramabana_lead, with ramabana’s read and web tools and its sub-agents) gather a passage for each step of walk jid that has none, with gather_tools, for at most research.agent_minutes and AGENT_DOCS documents. stop ends it: each tool refuses, and the turn is cancelled. Return passages, read and why. When the agent cannot start, j.gather_why says why, and research_walk finds the passages. The end (_gather_end) runs in a finally, so a crash also forgets an unused paper and puts the steps back to Find a source.




